==Current Cabinet==
{{Main|Second Honda cabinet}}

The current cabinet, led by Prime Minister [[Honda Shigetsuma]], was formally inaugurated on 5 November 2025 following the formation of the [[Progressive Party of Okaiken|PPO]]–[[Okaiken Socialist Party|OSP]] coalition.

